  <sys:String x:Key="Loc0081" xml:space="preserve">Open the seven-part or perk screen.
Check the zones and return focus to the game.
F8 — start · F7 — read · F10 — stop.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Loc0082" xml:space="preserve">Open a part (RECALIBER), a roll menu or UPGRADE with seven parts in the game, then click. The app reads the screen once without input, detects the game interface area (16:9 between black bars), places zones from reference screenshots and verifies them by reading the breadcrumb, perks, set, part or parts row. Zones are saved only when all checks pass; the frame and report go to Logs\Calibration.</sys:String>
